{
  "title": "Stems",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Separate any WAV file",
        "into individual stems:",
        " - Drums",
        " - Vocals",
        " - Accompaniment",
        "",
        "Uses the SpleeterRT",
        "engine at about 0.85x",
        "realtime speed.",
        "A 4-minute song takes",
        "about 3.5 minutes.",
        "",
        "Long files are split",
        "into 60-second parts",
        "and rejoined, so any",
        "length works."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "How to Use",
      "lines": [
        "1. Select a WAV file",
        "   from the browser",
        "2. Confirm to start",
        "   processing",
        "3. Wait for separation",
        "   (progress shown)",
        "4. Review stems with",
        "   checkboxes to keep",
        "5. Push Save All or",
        "   select individual",
        "   stems to save"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Stem Review",
      "lines": [
        "After processing, you",
        "see a stem checklist.",
        "",
        "All stems are selected",
        "by default.",
        "",
        "Jog: scroll stems",
        "Push: toggle select",
        "Save All: keep all",
        "Save N: keep selected",
        "Cancel: discard all",
        "",
        "Output saved to:",
        " Samples/Schwung/",
        "  Stems/<filename>/"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Output",
      "lines": [
        "Stems are saved to:",
        " UserLibrary/Samples/",
        "  Schwung/Stems/",
        "   <filename>/",
        "",
        "Each stem is a WAV",
        "file: drums.wav,",
        "vocals.wav, and",
        "accompaniment.wav",
        "",
        "44.1kHz stereo,",
        "32-bit float."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
